ent-MachineAnomalyVessel = 異常載體 | anomaly vessel
    .desc = 一個能夠利用異常的掃描結果，並將其轉化為研究資料的容器。 | A container able to harness a scan of an anomaly and turn it into research data.
ent-MachineAnomalyVesselExperimental = 實驗性異常載體 | experimental anomaly vessel
    .desc = 一種先進的異常載體，雖能發揮更大的研究潛力，但代價是波動性增加，且會向環境中釋放低劑量的放射性衰變物質。 | An advanced anomaly vessel capable of greater research potential at the cost of increased volatility and low-level radioactive decay into the environment.
ent-MachineAPE = A.P.E. | A.P.E.
    .desc = 一種「異常粒子發射器」，能夠射出不穩定的粒子，這些粒子可與異常現象產生交互作用。 | An Anomalous Particle Emitter, capable of shooting out unstable particles which can interface with anomalies.
ent-MachineAnomalyGenerator = 異常產生器 | anomaly generator
    .desc = 偽科學技術的巔峰。 | The peak of pseudoscientific technology.
